# GeneralsX @build Claude 19/08/2026 Keep the build context for Dockerfile.dev tiny.
#
# Dockerfile.dev is built with the repository ROOT as its context - godmode passes the
# worktree as the context for `agent.base_dockerfile`, and the documented hand build is
# `docker build -f resources/dockerbuild/Dockerfile.dev .` from the root - and the repository
# is ~500k LOC plus references/ and build/. Dockerfile.dev deliberately COPYs nothing but the
# vcpkg dependency manifests - the checkout itself is bind-mounted at runtime - so everything
# else is excluded here.
#
# `*` also excludes `.git`, which is wanted twice over: the image needs no history, and in a
# godmode worktree `.git` is a file pointing at a directory outside the context anyway.
#
# GeneralsX @bugfix Claude 20/08/2026 scripts/env/docker/docker-build-images.sh now builds
# the Linux image from Dockerfile.dev with the repository root as its context too, so this
# file governs that build as well. The remaining images (Dockerfile.mingw, Dockerfile) still
# use resources/dockerbuild/ as their context and are unaffected.
*
!vcpkg.json
!vcpkg-lock.json
!triplets
